# Acceptance variant: both racers use the proven Dragster rhythm, with P2's horizontal drive mirrored to its validated Left direction.
# Ordinary two-player route with a decided first race, then the post-race 2P flow.
# start:duration:p1-mask:p2-mask (requires tools/patches/snesrecomp-dual-controller-input.patch).
# Frames < 1134: tests/input/two-player-first-race.input (P1 MIKE, P2 ANDREW, Crawler Dragster).
# 1194..3800: P1 reuses the proven Dragster Right rhythm; P2 mirrors it as Left from the ordinary-2P causal movement seam.
# Both racers are actively driven so stock Results can resolve without waiting for the ordinary-2P idle-racer timeout.
# Acceptance exits immediately after the persisted pair is committed; no post-race menu drive is required.
